<title>UK: Asfinag sets 1.0 bln CZK one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Asfinag sets 1.0 bln CZK one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUTOBAHNEN-UND SCHNELLSTRASSEN FINANZIERUNGS AG</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.875    MATURITY    26.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY     *AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC   0.85</p>
<p> NOTES	*GUARANTOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
